<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT ESTONIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT ESTONIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria beat Estonia 2-0 in</p>
<p>their World Cup European</p>
<p>group four qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Ivica Vastic 48, Peter Stoeger 87</p>
<p>Attendance:27,500</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Austria: 1-Michael Konsel, 2-Harald Cerny, 3-Peter Schoettel</p>
<p>(15-Walter Kogler 68), 4-Anton Pfeffer, 5-Wolfgang Feiersinger,</p>
<p>6-Andreas Heraf, 7-Ivica Vastic (18-Peter Stoeger 48) 8-Dietmar</p>
<p>Kuehbauer, 9-Anton Polster, 10-Andreas Herzog, 11-Arnold Wetl</p>
<p>Estonia: 1-Mart Poom, 2-Marek Lemsalu, 3-Urmas Kirs,</p>
<p>4-Sergei Hohlov-Simson, 5-Janek Meet, 6-Viktor Alonen (16-Argo</p>
<p>Arbeiter 79), 7-Kristen Viikmae (15-Liivo Leetma 82), 8-Mati</p>
<p>Pari (17-Meelis Rooba 63), 9-Marko Kristal, 10-Martin Reim,</p>
<p>11-Andres Oper.</p>
<p>    Standings	 P   W   D   L   F   A   PTS</p>
<p> Scotland	     7   4   2   1   8   2   14</p>
<p> Austria		5   3   1   1   5   3   10</p>
<p> Sweden		 5   3   0   2   9   5    9</p>
<p> Estonia		5   1   1   3   1   5    4</p>
<p> Latvia		 5   1   1   3   5   7    4</p>
<p> Belarus		5   1   1   3   3   9    4</p>
</text>
